version: "2.0.0"
date-released: 2026-10-30

abstract: "Reproducible physical power-grid contingency checks for the observability limits of the previously published vertex eccentricity labeled energy invariant. Includes six-system MATPOWER DC proxy evidence and source-rated PGLib-OPF v23.07 capacity-cut lower bounds for thirteen consequential IEEE118 connected outages; four have unchanged VELE. Historical candidate AC optimality is not claimed."
keywords:
  - power systems
  - vulnerability screening
  - spectral graph theory
  - MATPOWER
  - DC power flow
  - reproducibility
